# Kart buraxılışı hesab <accountId> məbləğ <amount> ləqəb <label>
* "accountId" deyişenine <accountId> deyerini ver
* "amount" deyişenine <amount> deyerini ver
* "label" deyişenine <label> deyerini ver
* Initalize request specification
* Add Endpoint "/cards"
* Authorization header-ine tokeni elave et
* Add body as file resource "card-create.json"
* Post request and display respons

